{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "架构策略（ZCode 能力内化 · P 线）。检查器：scripts/architecture/check.mjs；命令：node scripts/architecture/check.mjs [--changed] [--update-baseline] [--self-test]。规则：① 顶层模块目录必须在此登记（新增模块先登记，未登记即报红）；② 新建文件不得超过 maxFileLines，存量超限文件按 architecture-baseline.json 冻结、只禁增长；③ Rust 模块的 path 依赖边必须在 requires 白名单内；④ TS 跨包依赖边必须在 requires 白名单内（镜像 ③）；⑤ TS 包间不得成环。",
  "_status": "v1.1（2026-09-21）：TS 依赖边白名单已启用（40 条现存边登记入库）；阈值 400/1200 经 P4 基线数据复核维持（分布：>400 共 218/1555 ≈14%，存量冻结兜底）；knip 类工具评估后延后独立批次。",
  "global": {
    "maxFileLines": 400,
    "overrides": [
      {
        "match": "tests",
        "maxFileLines": 1200
      },
      {
        "match": ".spec.",
        "maxFileLines": 1200
      },
      {
        "match": ".test.",
        "maxFileLines": 1200
      }
    ],
    "scanExtensions": [
      ".rs",
      ".ts",
      ".tsx",
      ".vue",
      ".mjs"
    ],
    "excludeDirs": [
      "node_modules",
      "target",
      "dist",
      "pkg",
      ".git",
      "gen",
      "generated",
      "mock-cdn"
    ],
    "discoveryRoots": [
      "crates",
      "crates/vendor",
      "packages",
      "apps",
      "worldsea-core",
      "tactical-engine"
    ]
  },
  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "worldsea-core",
      "kind": "rust",
      "roots": [
        "worldsea-core/src"
      ],
      "manifest": "worldsea-core/Cargo.toml",
      "requires": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tactical-engine",
      "kind": "rust",
      "roots": [
        "tactical-engine/src"
      ],
      "manifest": "tactical-engine/Cargo.toml",
      "requires": []
    },
    {
      "id": "tauri-backend",
      "kind": "rust",
      "roots": [
        "apps/tauri/src-tauri/src"
      ],
      "manifest": "apps/tauri/src-tauri/Cargo.toml",
      "requires": [
        "worldsea-core"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tauri-app",
      "kind": "ts",
      "roots": [
        "apps/tauri/src"
      ],
      "manifest": "apps/tauri/package.json",
      "requires": [
        "canvas-engine",
        "core-api-types",
        "entity-core",
        "font-kit",
        "motion-kit",
        "perf-kit",
        "plugin-sdk",
        "shared-composables",
        "shared-ui",
        "ui-kit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "canvas-engine",
      "kind": "ts",
      "roots": [
        "packages/canvas-engine/src"
      ],
      "manifest": "packages/canvas-engine/package.json",
      "requires": [
        "entity-core"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "core-api-types",
      "kind": "ts",
      "roots": [
